            "trait_description": {
              "value": "Whenever the cranium preserver ends a Stride, the movement causes necrotic embalming fluid and preserved body parts to slosh about and spill from its central vat. Each creature adjacent to the cranium preserver when it finishes its Stride must attempt a DC 26 Will save.\n\nCritical Success: \nSuccess: \nFailure: \nCritical Failure: "
